    "prompt": "A helicopter flew from a town on a bearing of $315^\\circ$ and travelled for 40 km to pick up its cargo from a depot. The helicopter then carried the cargo to a construction site on a bearing of $225^\\circ$. The construction site is 105 km from the town.",
